r free.\n\nReason: Since the opponent just called the blind, checking is the most prudent play. It allows you to see the flop without increasing the pot size with a marginal hand out of position. This minimizes risk while retaining the potential to hit a strong hand or win at showdown with Ace-high.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
